{"speciesId":49,"names":{"fr":"Aéromite","es":"Venomoth","en":"Venomoth","ja":"モルフォン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"The dust-like scales covering its wings are color coded to indicate the kinds of poison it has."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"The dust-like scales covering its wings are color coded to indicate the kinds of poison it has."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"The powdery scales on its wings are hard to remove. They also contain poison that leaks out on contact."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"When it attacks, it flaps its large wings violently to scatter its poi­ sonous powder all around."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"The powder on its wings is poisonous if it is dark in color. If it is light, it causes paralysis."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"The scales it scatters will paralyze anyone who touches them, making that person unable to stand."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"VENOMOTH is nocturnal - it is a POKéMON that only becomes active at night. Its favorite prey are small insects that gather around streetlights, attracted by the light in the darkness."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"VENOMOTH is nocturnal - it is a POKéMON that only becomes active at night. Its favorite prey are small insects that gather around streetlights, attracted by the light in the darkness."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"VENOMOTH are nocturnal--they only are active at night. Their favorite prey are insects that gather around streetlights, attracted by the light in the darkness."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"The wings are covered with dustlike scales. Every time it flaps its wings, it looses highly toxic dust."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"The dustlike scales covering its wings are color-coded to indicate the kinds of poison it has."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It flutters its wings to scatter dustlike scales. The scales leach toxins if they contact skin."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It flutters its wings to scatter dustlike scales. The scales leach toxins if they contact skin."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It flutters its wings to scatter dustlike scales. The scales leach toxins if they contact skin."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"When it attacks, it flaps its large wings violently to scatter its poisonous powder all around."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"The powder on its wings is poisonous if it is dark in hue. If it is light in hue, it causes paralysis."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il répand ses écailles poudreuses en battant des ailes. Elles sont toxiques au toucher."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It flutters its wings to scatter dustlike scales. The scales leach toxins if they contact skin."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il répand ses écailles poudreuses en battant des ailes. Elles sont toxiques au toucher."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It flutters its wings to scatter dustlike scales. The scales leach toxins if they contact skin."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It flutters its wings to scatter dustlike scales. The scales leach toxins if they contact skin."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It flutters its wings to scatter dustlike scales. The scales leach toxins if they contact skin."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Les écailles qu’il sème ont le pouvoir de paralyser totalement un ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Lanza unas escamas que paralizan a cualquiera. Quien las toque, no podrá ni ponerse de pie."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The scales it scatters will paralyze anyone who touches them, making that person unable to stand."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ばらまかれた りんぷんに 触れると 体の 感覚が おかしくなって まっすぐ 立っていられなくなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses ailes sont couvertes d’écailles poudreuses. À chaque battement d’ailes, il laisse tomber de la poudre hautement toxique."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Tiene las alas cubiertas de un polvillo de escamas que esparce cada vez que las bate."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The wings are covered with dustlike scales. Every time it flaps its wings, it looses highly toxic dust."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"羽に りんぷんが ついていて ヒラヒラと 羽ばたくたびに 猛毒の 粉を ばらまく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Aéromite est un Pokémon nocturne, il ne sort donc que la nuit. Ses proies préférées sont les petits insectes qui se rassemblent autour des réverbères, attirés par la lumière."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Venomoth es nocturno, solo actúa en la oscuridad. Su alimento preferido son los pequeños insectos que se concentran cerca de los focos de luz en la oscuridad de la noche."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Venomoth is nocturnal—it is a Pokémon that only becomes active at night. Its favorite prey are small insects that gather around streetlights, attracted by the light in the darkness."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"夜行性で 夜に 活動を 始める。 街灯の 灯りに 誘われ 集まった 小さな 虫を 好んで 食べる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Aéromite est un Pokémon nocturne, il ne sort donc que la nuit. Ses proies préférées sont les petits insectes qui se rassemblent autour des réverbères, attirés par la lumière."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Venomoth es nocturno, solo actúa en la oscuridad. Su alimento preferido son los pequeños insectos que se concentran cerca de los focos de luz en la oscuridad de la noche."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Venomoth is nocturnal—it is a Pokémon that only becomes active at night. Its favorite prey are small insects that gather around streetlights, attracted by the light in the darkness."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","tex